Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 22:01:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4224/5749] refactor(agent-key): use getAgentListDisplayName
 for consistent key remapping

Update agent key remapper and tests to use getAgentListDisplayName

for proper runtime-facing list names in OpenCode display.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
---
 .../agent-key-remapper.test.ts                | 59 +++++++++----------
 src/plugin-handlers/agent-key-remapper.ts     |  4 +-
 2 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/plugin-handlers/agent-key-remapper.test.ts b/src/plugin-handlers/agent-key-remapper.test.ts
index e792d875..7640fbbf 100644
--- a/src/plugin-handlers/agent-key-remapper.test.ts
+++ b/src/plugin-handlers/agent-key-remapper.test.ts
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
